Don't fail a Claude reviewer on non-assistant stream events

Claude Code can emit system events whose "message" is a plain string.
The review parser decoded every envelope's message as an object, so
such an event turned into a RunError and the reviewer was reported as
Failed even though its review completed. The message is now decoded
only for assistant envelopes.

